The Nethack wiki is moving to http://nethackwiki.com. Please update
your bookmarks. Simply replace "nethack.wikia.com" everywhere with
"nethackwiki.com".

Right now, the domain still redirects to Wikia, so you can safely
change your links. As soon as feasible, it will be switched over to
the new wiki, hosted on the same server as nethack.alt.org.

The results of the vote this weekend whether the wiki should move: 157
(72%) for move, 42 (19%) for stay, and 19 (9%) for undecided. In
total, there were 218 votes.


